     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Small, dependency-free Memory Foundation for newWork v2.
     3	
     4	The .yaml files contain JSON, which is valid YAML 1.2. Events are the source of
     5	truth; STATE/FINDINGS/LESSONS are replaceable projections.
     6	"""
